OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'one-of-a-kind'
OL,4,Aman after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a father,
OL,7,Fgrandfather and great-grandfather, who
OL,8,Fwas hit by a car five days after his
OL,9,F84th birthday.
OL,11,FPedestrian Charlie Watt was seriously
OL,12,Finjured in the crash on Cottingham
OL,13,FRoad, Corby, Northamptonshire at about
OL,14,F16:30 BST on Saturday, 22 August and
OL,15,Fdied in hospital the next day.
OL,17,FIn a statement, his family said: "He
OL,18,Fhad a wonderful sense of humour, and
OL,19,Fmany stories to tell. He was a truly
OL,20,Fspecial, one-of-a-kind character. If
OL,21,Fyou met Charlie, you definitely
OL,22,Fwouldn't forget him."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
